-- 只读探针（不 SAVEWORK，不进录制清单）：joint/ 下 AMS 用例动到的元素，在 E3D 里各问一遍身份与现值。
-- 库: ams7999（MDB /ALL）。写腿都按 refno 导航；这里先确认这些 refno 在副本里就是期望的那几只。
-- 每次导航后跟 handle：走不到就打一行 NAV-FAILED，后面几句查询的输出不算数。
ONERROR CONTINUE
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-JOINT-PROBE-PJOI-AMS-ALIVE
$P ==== E0361 BAR-1 ====
=24383/87946
handle any
$P NAV-FAILED 24383/87946
endhandle
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q OWNER
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q DRNS
Q DRNE
Q BANG
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
Q JLIN
Q JUSL
Q SPRE
Q POSS WRT /*
Q POSE WRT /*
$P ==== E0361 PNOD ====
=24383/87947
handle any
$P NAV-FAILED 24383/87947
endhandle
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q OWNER
Q NPOS
Q NPOS WRT /*
$P ==== E0361 PJOI ====
=24383/87948
handle any
$P NAV-FAILED 24383/87948
endhandle
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q OWNER
Q SPRE
Q CREF
Q GTYP
Q DELP
Q OPDI
Q CUTP
Q CUTB
Q BANG
Q JFRE
Q JLIN
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
